# PR merge gate

For full policy and CI behavior, see `CONTRIBUTING.md` → “Review check before merge”.

- Do not merge a draft or a ready PR with unresolved actionable bot findings, unless the user explicitly waived that hold.
- For a ready PR, request one CodeRabbit review on the current HEAD. Wait for pending reviews. On-demand skips are not rate limits.
- If every available review surface is rate-limited beyond 10 minutes, do a main-agent diff review and record the attempts/reset in a one-line PR note. A local review does not change GitHub status.
- Run `./scripts/check_pr_reviews.sh` and disposition every actionable finding before merge. CI soft-pass alone is not a review.
- Jev advises on workflow only; it cannot review code or waive this gate.
